  "original_busy_control": "Original C loses trailing logs under the already documented sustained-bus-load control; candidate passes.",
  "corrections": [
    "The first full collector stopped after 52 gates; its completed logs are verified, its incomplete result is retained.",
    "An outer sudo removed HELPERS and selected stale /tmp helpers. An explicit argument plus source/binary manifests now pins the helpers.",
    "r36 now waits for closed CLI connections before its fd baseline and rejects growth even if both sides leak.",
    "r83 explicitly asserts the documented atomic non-UTF-8 rename rejection; every other output and scratch byte remains compared."
  ],
